33. IMPORTANT INTERVIEW QUESTIONS

Q1. What is Express.js?

Express.js is a Node.js framework used to build web servers and APIs.

Q2. What is middleware?

Middleware is a function that executes during the request-response cycle.

Q3. What is routing?

Routing defines how an application responds to different URLs and HTTP methods.

Q4. What is req.params?

req.params is used to access route parameters.

Q5. What is req.query?

req.query is used to access query parameters.

Q6. What is req.body?

req.body is used to access data sent in the request body.

Q7. What is express.json()?

express.json() is middleware used to parse incoming JSON data.

Q8. What is app.use()?

app.use() is used to register middleware in an Express application.

Q9. What is REST API?

REST API is an API architecture used for communication between client and server.

Q10. What is CRUD?

CRUD stands for Create, Read, Update and Delete.